<style>
  .forgot-wrap {
    position: relative; z-index: 1;
    display: flex; justify-content: center;
    padding: 48px 20px;
  }
  .forgot-card { width: 100%; max-width: 520px; text-align: center; }
  .forgot-icon {
    width: 72px; height: 72px; margin: 0 auto 18px;
    border-radius: 22px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--primary-dark));
    color: #fff; font-size: 30px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(211, 47, 47, 0.35);
  }
  .forgot-title {
    font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-dark);
    font-family: 'ZCOOL XiaoWei', 'Noto Serif SC', serif;
    letter-spacing: 1px; margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .forgot-desc { font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-light); line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .forgot-tip { margin-top: 20px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; }
  .forgot-back { margin-top: 18px; font-size: 13px; }
  .forgot-back a { color: var(--primary); text-decoration: none; }
  .forgot-back a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
</style>

<div class="forgot-wrap">
  <div class="card forgot-card">
    <div class="forgot-icon"><i class="fas fa-key"></i></div>
    <div class="forgot-title">找回密码</div>
    <p class="forgot-desc">
      D5ST 使用 Casdoor 统一认证管理账号，密码重置需要在 Casdoor 认证中心完成。<br />
      点击下方按钮前往，按提示通过邮箱验证码重设密码。
    </p>
    <a href="<%= casdoorForgotUrl %>" class="btn primary btn-block" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      <i class="fas fa-arrow-up-right-from-square btn-icon"></i> 前往 Casdoor 找回密码
    </a>
    <p class="forgot-tip">如果遇到问题，请联系网站管理员。</p>
    <div class="forgot-back"><a href="/login"><i class="fas fa-arrow-left"></i> 返回登录</a></div>
  </div>
</div>
